Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones\Nwe love. We'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core\Nis against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know, that's\Nwhat we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.35,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she's turned\Nback to her own self.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Pudding's Cake have really been\Nthat finger-licking lickety-good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her with such a\Nlickety-blissful expression before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I need you to snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to give you an\Nupdated status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, Buggy should\Nstill be somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.74,0:03:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship, that's not the\NStraw Hats vessel at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That vessel belongs to the Sun Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they switch places? Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did the Straw Hats go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry them all to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the legendary ship\Nthat Fisher Tiger made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them! Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You see them, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we wind up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Concealed in Waratsumi's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I saw something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the giant hairy baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships turn 180 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Scumbags, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tropical torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, Straw Hat's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't stop till they're sunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go on without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I know I did a\Nbad thing on Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm real sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, Boss Chief may still\Nlet me tag along after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll always be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you told us you wanted to\Njoin Straw Hat, we made up our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's the type of person who will\Nkill anyone who tries to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sha-sha-sha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we have\Nto do then, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll serve as Captain Jinbei's\Nshield and die in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't all get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to tell the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't deny that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No judgment to those who back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But for those who are brave enough,\Nprepare yourselves for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we shall let these fools know,\Nno one can stop Jinbei's new voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our minds were made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maratsumi, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, lad, everyone's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave these guys to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sending you off with our blessings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men, let's do this! Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's great weakness is flooding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The water must be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the situation worsens!.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is getting heavy and slow?.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, hatch up the hole in the sail and\Nfind the proper angle to catch the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You must work as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still several hours out\Nfrom leaving this territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you spouting that junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot bring myself to leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stay and help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover your backs\Nto ensure your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If the mothership and its fleet remain\Nat our heels, escape will be impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I implore you, allow me to\Nstay and bring up the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my solemn vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Bane, I'm your captain\Nnow, so don't let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you and Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You better show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, no matter what! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me someone took care\Nof that Straw Hat brat. He's still
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,alive but he has nowhere left to hide\Nright about now my siblings should
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,be giving him the lickety-licking\Nof his life they have him near
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,cacao island if he's not confirmed\Ndead then i'll go finish him off let's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,go dark spotted candy frog sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,boy it's over i want your soul and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm gonna use it to make my most
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful homies yet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,we
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,scraped
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,through
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,with our lives looks like lady luck\Nwas on our side now let's scram
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,While it's quiet, I'm really a little\Nworried about Gemma. Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn to death. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Aladdin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, staying after all? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still a member of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to save my captain,\NI must remain here and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be pulling my fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What little faith you have in us, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't think of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ensuring your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like a proper send-off from everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know firsthand just\Nwhat you're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use that tenacity to assist\Nwith the Sunnies' escape, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sherman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our big chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to move at full speed immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When Fishman gets serious,\Nwe're able to big currents!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing! We'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is really speeding up now that\Nthe fishmen shifted the tide for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are leaving Team Bay\Nbehind, but they're getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fleet's being pushed back by the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear we'll lose sight\Nof their ship soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stuffed Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when are you in his corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's because he's a contender!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Stussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Surgeon of Death, Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magician, Basil Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Flag, Diaz, Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Roar of the Sea, Scratchman, Apu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Capone, Gang, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Glutton, Jewelry, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad Monk, Rougie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass, Captain Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The Massacre, Soldier, Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard Marshal D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Will rise above the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And take up the legendary mantle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The next pirate king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lies amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So Pedro's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help. Duke,\Ndog, storm, and master cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,viper are in need of\Nurgent medical assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of their lives are at stake\Nin the world still needs them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Above all else those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They must absolutely be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like this isn't where\Nyou were supposed to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't beat yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro acted of his own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't feel\Nresponsible for it, alrighty?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You two guys saved the Mokumo dukedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we wanted to repay our dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd have all died back there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So please
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be thankful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how he wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand I know how Pedro was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha! Soul focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Echoes of the heart as we depart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It weighs heavy on our mind,\Nthe friends we left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the tide take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As the shade so gently sways.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing a lullaby for the\Nbattle scars of yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cotton candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It means we're approaching the\Nedge of Big Mom's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more and we'll\Nbe out of Toto Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's on her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wearing borrowed smiles from those Who
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,traded their humanity Twisted lies like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:21:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,vines that wind so gently around me Songs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That you sing thus so sweetly. So look,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,oh God?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama sings the passage for this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,cruel tragedy For all her family
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince from a fairy tale
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess in a word of fear
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppets show for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,certain Hiding tears behind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the curtain With a sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,nectar that draws us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,with its flavor Hides a wickedness that's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:22:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,difficult to Cipher Tempting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,candy laid out grandly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rots your soul like a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cavity made in feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked away. And only
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Caused his breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In someone else's place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the candy queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no room here for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,machine If you want to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish and karate in\Ntechnique. Vagabond drill
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the line until Luffy and his crew\Nare out, and then we can fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way yet for their units in pursuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that we may have lost them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.86,0:23:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they cross the border,\Nwe're screwed! Now go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the drill. Pudding\Nuse your acting chops to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.56,0:23:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,make that fool fall head over\Nheels for you You can count
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,on me mama think of yourself\Nas a doll under my control
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.22,0:23:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,pudding Because that's\Nexactly what you are my dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.46,0:24:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama i'm not a doll
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But then let's get married
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.10,0:24:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. You'll just be\Nhorrified like all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my daughter, but that eye\Nstill freaks me out. It's the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Very mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound just like a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.12,0:24:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.86,0:24:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No one more left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A disgusting freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll run away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you learn what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.76,0:24:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see my hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Third eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.87,0:24:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you would hide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.78,0:25:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to start begging.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to fake marry\Nsomeone, I'm glad it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.62,0:25:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.64,0:25:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you have a favor to ask of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.98,0:26:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedal Spedal!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.02,0:26:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me if Mama's with you. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to your, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a call from Cacao Island. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.74,0:27:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a report from the\Nterritory. At the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.66,0:27:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alerting us of passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.58,0:27:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat ship has\Nleft Totoland coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.38,0:27:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your ships, Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.14,0:27:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.30,0:27:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.54,0:27:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa has retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.64,0:27:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.96,0:27:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to see you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not with\Nyour back to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You were on your stomach\Nthe first time you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.64,0:28:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you get up just\Nto land on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.90,0:28:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.46,0:28:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But Barrel, the whole I never put my back\Non the ground rumor, it held no truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.92,0:28:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've witnessed it through the mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.86,0:28:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.46,0:28:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretending to be invincible and perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All for our sake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.88,0:28:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.80,0:28:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, you could make friends\Nif you covered that big old mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.58,0:28:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone laughs, then\NI'll just beat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.86,0:28:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a pelican heel. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.64,0:28:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They can walk out my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.64,0:28:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.55,0:28:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.42,0:29:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.90,0:29:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? It's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel got hurt really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.44,0:29:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She what? Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.48,0:29:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.08,0:29:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're bleeding from the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.46,0:29:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All those dumb jerks you beat up\Ntook it out on Barrel as revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.10,0:29:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.72,0:29:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.63,0:29:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't supposed to turn out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.74,0:29:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.00,0:29:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.44,0:29:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget those jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.02,0:29:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fine just the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.36,0:30:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it. You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell was hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.80,0:30:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.00,0:30:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come, stupid eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.42,0:30:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,About time we've been expecting you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that crap around your neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.10,0:30:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you\Ndid to my sister's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let my guard down ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the meaning of true fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.72,0:30:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulley.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.82,0:30:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.12,0:30:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.92,0:30:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be relieved to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.90,0:30:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can see ahead into the future too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.34,0:30:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He just left our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:30:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive him, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not after what he did to you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.14,0:31:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.90,0:31:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's far past the border by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.98,0:31:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.22,0:31:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Gemma Double Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.74,0:31:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one of them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.04,0:31:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.26,0:31:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul poke us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.06,0:32:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When selfish words can hold us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lured by a cake slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.06,0:32:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's better to think twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon enough you'll see how\Nmuch that you must sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.96,0:32:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no gain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Power reigns here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.42,0:32:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All is ruled by fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.18,0:32:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring a treat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.34,0:32:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it sweet, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.22,0:32:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll find your end is quite near.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempting candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.10,0:32:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Laid out grandly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Berets your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.14,0:32:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a cavity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.18,0:32:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.38,0:33:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chef like a crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.20,0:33:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.58,0:33:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give your lifespan and breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.98,0:33:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.90,0:33:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the queen's last song.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.74,0:33:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice is yours, life or death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.32,0:33:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With the powerful forces\Nof the Sun Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.14,0:33:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and Gemma Double Six guarding their backs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.50,0:33:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats make their escape at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.24,0:33:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny, now leaving the\NEmperor Big Mom's territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.82,0:33:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,presses on towards its next adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.94,0:34:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe I can make you\Nall something? Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.32,0:34:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.80,0:34:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.16,0:34:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just dying of hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even help!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get by while I was gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me you ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.82,0:34:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shortly after, in the East Blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.32,0:34:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell's my meal? It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chef Zeff, why are we tolerating this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.72,0:34:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.32,0:34:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,These juts are our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.56,0:34:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.02,0:34:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.32,0:34:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, what's the hold-up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.20,0:34:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really pushing their luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.24,0:34:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.90,0:34:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,People get hungry every hour of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.00,0:35:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the bad guys need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.58,0:35:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.44,0:35:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're hungry, then I'll feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.72,0:35:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll settle the rest later.
